      "message": "[error] Line 915: 🔴 `rtcpPending_` is cleared unconditionally by the first waiter, which can drop notifications when multiple RTCP packets/checkers are in play: one thread can consume the flag while another checker still has unread RTCP relevant to it, and subsequent `waitForRTCP()` calls may block until timeout/new traffic. Use a monotonic event counter (or per-checker sequence) instead of a single bool, or clear pending only after the corresponding RTCP queues are drained under the same lock.",
